// Buildings the server adds to Lymhurst (cluster 1000; analysis/work/stageN/stations/SPEC.md, Content/StationSpawns): the same ownerless
// public crafting and refining stations as Thetford's (content/spawns/0000.json), one per RealEstate plot centre of the 1000 template
// (20 x 20 plots, best locationquality first, then nearest the bank entrance).
// City bonus (craftingmodifiers.xml by cluster, applied by the station handler to the map the crafter stands on):
//   refining and crafting +18 %, fiber +40 %, goose +10 %, swords, bows, arcane staffs, leather helmets and shoes +15 %.
// The bank (1001) and the market (1002) are Lymhurst's own clusters with their own vault and orders; nothing here is shared.
// "Building" is a buildings.xml uniquename, "Position" [x, z] in world coordinates, "Direction" the facing in degrees. Read at server start.
